# class: clearances
# twin-of: single-leaf-2400
# origin: audits/showcase-and-examples.md MR2 with the 2400 mm doorway hung as a pair of leaves (`door double`)
# expect: none
# fact: d_main is a double door 2400 mm wide: two hinged leaves of 1200 mm, one on each jamb
plan "A 2400 mm pair of leaves" {
  units mm
  grid 50
  wall id=shell exterior thickness 200 { (0,0) (8000,0) (8000,6000) (0,6000) close }
  room id=r_hall at (0,0) size 8000x6000 label "Entrance Hall" uses entry
  door id=d_main double at (4000,6000) width 2400 wall shell swing into r_hall
  window at (4000,0) width 2000 wall shell
}
